   1:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c **** /**
   2:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  *  @addtogroup  Hareware Middle Layer
   3:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  *  @brief       Hardware Middle Layer, to access data from BSP and STM32 HAL Library
