   5:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  *  @{
   6:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  *      @file       HWDataAccess.c
   7:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  *      @brief      middleware, for UI and APP Layer to get the hardware data
   8:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  *      @details    you can enable or disable in .h file.
   9:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  * 					加这个文件就是为了方便UI移植, 比如你要把工程移植到PC仿真,
  10:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  *   				直接把MidFunc中的文件和UI文件都复制过去,
  11:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  * 					然后直接把.h文件中的HW_USE_HARDWARE变成0就行了.
  12:User/Func/Src/HWDataAccess.c ****  */
